<title>FRANCE: Cr. Agricole holds 7.48 of votes in Suez Lyonnaise.</title>
<headline>Cr. Agricole holds 7.48 of votes in Suez Lyonnaise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>French bank Credit Agricole holds 7.48 percent of the voting rights in the newly-merged Suez Lyonnaise des Eaux utilities group, the Council for Financial Markets regulator said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Credit Agricole was a shareholder in both Cie de Suez and Lyonnaise de Suez before the merger.</p>
<p>The bank now holds 144,136,533 voting rights.</p>
</text>
